window.products.push({"id":1097049,"name":"Rhino Zing 32-Ounce Beer Growler Stainless Steel Travel Set. Bundle Water Bottle, Sleeve/Pouch and Straw Lid. Insulated, Wide Mouth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sB50QTTZL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The giant Rhino Zing Beer Growler Included are:(1) 32 Oz Stainless Steel Beer Growler(1) Black Plastic Straw Lid(1) Black Neoprene Sleeve/Pouch The Standard Lid is attached to the bottle preventing loss and the Sleeve offers some protection against miner dings. The double wall surface, vacuum insulated bottle, made from food grade 18/8 stainless steel, is designed to keep liquids cool or hot for a very long time, avoids condensation and keeps the outside wall of the bottle at a comfy temperature level, regardless of whether it is lugging a warm or chilly drink. The Stainless Steel bottle and Straw Lid are One Hundred Percent BPA totally free. Feel confident in your beverage whether at the workplace or on an outdoor experience. Growler Dimensions: 4\"W x 9 1/2\"H., Capacity: 32 oz.Sleeve Dimensions: 8\" High and 4 1/2\" WideStrap Dimensions: 48\" Long and 3/4\" Wide To care for your bottle: Use simple non-metallic container brush or container sponge. Allow to completely dry in between each usage and also store with cover open. Do not microwave or freeze. To clean your Rhino Zing Neoprene Water Bottle Sleeve/Pouch, simply place in the washing matching with a normal load of laundry and air dry your sleeve completely before putting your bottle back into it. A wet sleeve can cause your bottle to rust or corrode, or you may experience a slight smell. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed. We stand behind out bottles. If you are not satisfied with your Stainless Steel Growler, you can return it for a replacement or refund. Items must be returned within 30 days of purchase. The Manufacture Limited Lifetime Warranty states if your Growler has a manufacturing defect in its materials or workmanship, you can return it at any time within the lifetime of the original owner. Our Limited Lifetime Warranty doesn't cover ordinary wear and tear or damage caused by improper use or accidents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sB50QTTZL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhino Zing","source_asin":"B01N1GN37K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1GN37K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1GN37K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
