window.products.push({"id":1097063,"name":"MADETEC Dehumidifier for Home, Upgraded 4000ml(128oz) Dehumidifiers for 5300 Cubic Feet 510 Sq.ft Portable Quiet Small Dehumidifier with Auto-Off for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/312xEyYCLpL._AC_.jpg","description":"High Efficient Dehumidification: This home dehumidifier adopts semiconductor condensation technology, which can effectively absorb excess moisture up to 1000ml (temperature: 86°F, humidity: 80%RH) from the air per day. In addition, designed with a 4000ml(128oz) water tank, it can achieve a lot of hours' continuous dehumidification. No need to frequently empty the water anymore. Keep Areas Up to 5300 Cubic Feet: Comes with double cooling semiconductors and 360° dehumidify, the dehumidification area reaches up to 5300 cubic feet 510sq.ft. Besides, the dehumidification effect of Gocheer dehumidifier is more than doubled. It is perfect for high humidity areas like your bathroom, small basement, closet, kitchen, living room. Say goodbye to excess moisture. Powerful & Quiet Modes: Gocheer compact dehumidifiers support two working modes. When in powerful mode, the fan of the home dehumidifier will set to a high level and it can reduce humidity quickly. When in quiet mode, it ensures the dehumidifier run quietly and the noise is less than 40dB, you will not feel disturbed when reading or sleeping. Just choose the different working modes according to your needs. Colorful lights & Timer Setting: Muti-colorful lights available, whether you like a single color or multiple colors, our safe dehumidifier can meet all your needs. Besides, the timing function allows the machine to work within a specified time, which can provide more convenience and save your electricity bill to the greatest extent. Automatic Shut Off: This portable dehumidifier will automatically shut down when the water tank is full of water or out of the machine to prevent the water tank from overflowing and protect the unit from damage. The indicator light will flash when the water tank needs to be emptied or not placed properly. Therefore, this dehumidifier for home provides a longer service time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/312xEyYCLpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MADETEC","source_asin":"B07HP3Q5QZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HP3Q5QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HP3Q5QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
