window.products.push({"id":1097268,"name":"Cold Brew Mason Jar Coffee Maker 32 Oz (1 Quart) Wide Mouth Cold Brew Pitcher with Coffee Filter, Airtight & Orange Hand Squeezer for Coffee, Iced Tea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YsjNbB6VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕HIGH QUALITY COLD BREW COFFEE MAKER - The cold brew coffee maker is made of high quality heat resistant borosilicate glass and food grade BPA free thickened plastic pour over lid for durability. The cold brew coffee maker is equipped with a 1000ml large capacity thickened glass jar, which is not easy to burst and has a non-slip effect. The cold brew coffee maker is assembled from multiple parts, all of which are removable for easy separation and cleaning, and dishwasher safe. ☕LEAK-PROOF SEAL: Since the cold brew coffee maker is equipped with two leak-proof silicone rings and a lock on the spout, it effectively prevents spills and leaks, keeping your drinks fresh and delicious for longer. You can put the cold brew coffee maker in drawers and travel bags, this cold brew coffee maker is perfect for indoor and outdoor use, such as camping, picnics, etc. ☕HIGH QUALITY FILTER: The cold brew coffee maker filter is made of food grade 304 stainless steel for durability. The mesh density effectively prevents coffee grounds from escaping and ensures your coffee is as smooth as silk. The cold brew coffee maker comes with a large capacity glass jar to store and mix with a variety of beverages to create your own perfect, personalized cup of bliss. ☕EAGLE BEAK LATCH DESIGN: The cold brew coffee maker's sliding lid is designed to stay in place, so when you pour or drink, the flap stays open and there are no more messy and awkward scenes. The hawkbill latch design ensures smooth water dispensing and precise water control. Pouring liquids from the Mason jar becomes enjoyable, safe and easy. ☕ERGONOMIC HANDLE: The ergonomically designed padded handle can support the weight of a full carafe without bending at all, making it easy to hold and use. The cold brew coffee pot is your best choice for storing coffee, iced tea, sun tea, lemonade, milk and other homemade juices. Let you enjoy a variety of refreshing beverages on hot summer days. ☕2 IN 1 MULTIPURPOSE: The juicer lid nozzle cover fits wide mouth Mason jars for large storage beverages or as a manual juicer squeezer. The manual juicer squeezer features a 9-tooth reamer designed to extract maximum juice that can be consumed daily for your family's juices. This 2-in-1 cold brew coffee maker is an essential tool for homes, kitchens, restaurants, cafes, bars and more, saving you time and effort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YsjNbB6VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRAWOLF","source_asin":"B09YRN93J8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRN93J8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRN93J8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
