window.products.push({"id":1097288,"name":"Vacuum Sealer, Etrigger One-button Automatic Food Sealer Machine Can be Used for Food Preservation and Sous Vide, Suitable for Home or Camping Use (Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SU3s-hAAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Etrigger focuses on the development of kitchenware, focusing on product quality and the customer's product experience. Etrigger Vacuum Sealer can help you store food, extend the shelf life of food, and maintain the nutrition and flavor of food, making your diet healthier.At the same time, it helps you reduce food waste, which saves you money and saves you time to go to the supermarket to buy food. It is a good assistant in your life. ☀Advantages of Vacuum Storage 1. Prevent mixing with other food flavors2. Prevent food spoilage3. Extended storage time4. Keep food fresh5. Meal preparation becomes simple6. Keep the refrigerator tidy7. Save storage space ☀Vacuum and Sealed Mode Operational Step Step 1 Fills the food Open the locks of two side buckles. Put the food in the bag and put the opening end in the vacuum chamber (Note: Please ensure that the edge of the bag does not exceed the vacuum chamber) Step 2 Close the lid Lock the two side buckles Step 3 Vacuum food and seal Press the work button and press the lid of the vacuum machine with both hands for 8s ☀Seal Only Mode Operation Steps Step 1 Fills the food Place the bag to be sealed on the Heating Sealing Strip and close the lid Step 2 Press the lid Press the lid of the vacuum sealer with both hands until the green LED indicator changes from red to green (Note: Don't press the work button) ☀Specifications *Power Supply: 110V/60Hz*Size: 14.2in x 2.2in x 2.0in*Sealing Width: Max 300mm*Vacuum Degree: -60kPa*Noise Value: less than 75dB*Vacuum Seal Time: 8 seconds*Seal Time: 5 seconds*Weight: 0.5kg*Power Cable: 150cm ☀Package List 1 * Vacuum Sealer15 * Vacuum Bags1 * User Manual ☀Satisfaction Guarantee Our products have 18 months warranty service, please rest assured to buy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SU3s-hAAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Etrigger","source_asin":"B089R715TY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089R715TY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089R715TY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
