window.products.push({"id":1097444,"name":"VANIRROR Recessed or Surface LED Mirror Medicine Cabinet with Lights, LED Medicine Cabinet with Clock and Temp Display/Defogger, Dimmer, Light Color C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":379.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lrl5QvJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏡VANIRROR LED bathroom medicine cabinet with 3 Seperate Touch Switches which has been certificated by UL Certified Electronic Parts. 👍The brightness of the LED Mirror Medicine Cabinet can be adjusted from 15% to 100% of its lumen by long pressing the power button. Short touch the color adjustment button to select 3000K warm light, 4,000K neutral white light, or 6,000K daylight as you wish👍 🏡Digital clock and temperature display (temperature in bathroom) shows on the surface of the mirror, which adds more convenient in your bathroom. 👍The memory function will remember the status of your favorite settings (connected with power). 👍The copper-free silver mirror offers mot only a clear, clean reflection experience, but also Environmental Protection. Our LED mirror medicine cabinet provides crystal clear image (CRI>90), which is perfect for make-up👍 🏡Inner LED Light switches on automatically, when you open up the door of medicine cabinet. 💪Built-in 20Amp dual outlet and USB 2.0 port are suitable for phone, shavers or electric toothbrushes, which allows you to charge in the bathroom mirror medicine cabinet. The 3x magnification cosmetic mirror makes every specific detail of your skin clearly visible. Three 8mm thick of interior shelves can be adjusted the appropriate distance by your needs💪 🏡Anti-Fog seperate touch switch provides the function of defogging or removing water drops. The separate anti-fog switch design makes this wall-mounted mirror much safer and energy-saving. 💪The Bathroom cabinet has passed the test of 50,000 hours durable LED Light lifetimes and 100,000 times switch touch. IP44 rated waterproof Anodized Aluminum Frame provided extra durability and safty in your bathroom💪 🏡32x20 Inch bathroom mirror medicine cabinet can be recessed or surfaced mount. 👍Modern frameless wall mirrors medicine cabinet design not only provides a functional design but also adds a sophisticated element to your bathroom space. 💪The sturdy packaging will protect the wall mirror well during shipping. If received a damaged mirror, feel free to contact us, and we will offer you a replacement or a full refund💪","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lrl5QvJsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANIRROR","source_asin":"B09LH9WG7R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LH9WG7R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LH9WG7R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
