window.products.push({"id":1097459,"name":"Ozera Silicone Ice Cube Trays with Lids for Whiskey and Cocktails, Keep Drinks Chilled-15 Cavity, One Size, blue & green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rZk6Ai8dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ice Cube Trays with Lids, Ozera 2 Pack Silicone Ice Cube Tray, 15 Cavity Flexible Ice Tray for Whiskey and Cocktails, Keep Drinks Chilled Just enjoy the cool summer with ice cube trays silicone! It will be a fantastic summer with your nice drink! Product Description: - Silicone ice cube tray with stackable and removable lids can prevent ice from absorbing other food air in the refrigerator to save space and not be stuck. Clean and tidy! - Ice cube molds are made of safe durable silicone material, not break after freezing for a long time. - Whiskey ice cubes have smooth silicone surface, easy to release the ice. - Each silicone ice cube tray makes 15 nice-sized cubes for a total of 30 to chill your drink. Great for home use, parties and bars etc. Tips: * Wash ice cube trays with lids in boiling water before the first use. * Please wait for 1-2 minutes makes it easier to release ice! * Never use brute force to take ice! * Keep ice cube trays silicone dry after using. About Ozera: Ozera highly appreciates all customers' opinions to improve the selling , also if anything you unsatisfied, pls contact our customer service department for probable best solution. Click the \"Add to Cart\" button now to make us a buddy in your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rZk6Ai8dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ozera","source_asin":"B0892PB6H8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892PB6H8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892PB6H8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1097460,"name":"Glass Gadgets The Only Glass Butter Keeper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519UavRppWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Somewhere between rock hard and melty puddles, there exists a perfectly spreadable butter consistency. It's easy to achieve that soft, perpetually creamy texture with this innovative butter keeper. Inspired by a traditional European design, the thick glass dish preserves butter at the optimal temperature outside of the refrigerator, preventing spoiling and maintaining freshness and shape. Simply fill the sturdy base with a small amount of tap water, placing the butter-filled lid upside down into the base. The water serves to prevent air from prematurely drying and aging the butter, while the clear glass design offers an at-a-glance view of the contents. The glass butter keeper measures approximately 5 by 5 by 5-1/2 inches and cleans up easily by hand or in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519UavRppWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glass Gadgets","source_asin":"B000FJD4A4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FJD4A4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FJD4A4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
