window.products.push({"id":1097499,"name":"Custom Pet Photo Pillow Cover, Personalized Cat & Dog Pillowcase, 20\" x 30\" Pet Throw Pillow Case with Photo Name, Two-Sides Printed Cushion Covers, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AtM3H-91L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plush Perfect Personalized Gift Idea: Add any picture you want to make special or customize a funny pillowcase. This pet pillow case is great for your house and also makes a very thoughtful. A unique gift that can fit everyone and since you can add any picture, it's a great home decor with your own design. Simply add any photo or use your imagination and upload a funny photo to smile at someone, reflect your style and make a meaningful pillow cover for your couch. Great Quality: Our photo pillow covers are made of high-quality Velvet material which are skin-friendly and comfortable. It is with the invisible zipper, please pay attention that the pillow insert is not included. The pictures on the pillow case are bright in color and can be washed in cold water without fading. Custom Pet Pillow Cover: The size of this custom pillow case is about 20x30 inches (50x75 cm) with double-sided printing. You can design the unique pet cushion cover by yourself, upload the pet's image, add the pet's name, choose the background colors. Please send us high-resolution photos for the best results. Now clicking \"Customize Now\" button to add your own design. If you want to add some text, please leave the message to us. Washing Tips: Our Pillowcase allows easy inserting and removing of the pillow inserts. Machine wash cold separately, gently cycle only, dot not bleach, tumble dry, do not iron and it'll look brand new. Cute&Meaningful Decorations: Your most precious memories are captured in a photo. Its stylish style perfectly match your sofa, bed or car seat and add a lot of charm to where you place it. It's a perfect gift for a Christmas party or event or a great keepsake & cherished gift! It's a great present for your Grandpa, Grandma, Dad, Mom, Aunts, Uncles, Husband, Wife, Son, Daughter, Brother, Sister, Cousins, Best Friend, Boyfriend, Girlfriend, Coworkers, Dog Lovers, Cat Lovers and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AtM3H-91L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEVONDESIGN","source_asin":"B0BR7KTJLH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR7KTJLH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR7KTJLH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
