window.products.push({"id":1097526,"name":"Snow Hill Himalayan Aromatherapy Organic Juniper - Berry Incense Handmade in Nepal Contain 41/45 Pcs X 3 Bundal - Used for Aesthetic Reasons Therapy M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gjeG6cgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Incense Rope is a Traditional Nepalese Incense called ”Dhup”. It is made by traditionally with many different precious Aromatic Himalayan herbs. The finely powder form of the herbs wrapped in the thin strip of Lokta Paper and twined forming stick called Incense. The smoke issuing out of the burnt Snow Hill Himalayan Meditation Incense is believed to attract the gods make peace of mind and body balance hence it has been put to an extensive use especially in the religious fields. The spiritual aspirant burns the incense while meditation in order to hold the mind focused on the object of attention. Light a Incense from thicker end and laid down on the Incense Burner. It is non toxic and non addictive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gjeG6cgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snow Hill","source_asin":"B085XNH65J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085XNH65J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085XNH65J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
