window.products.push({"id":1097576,"name":"Inflatable Sleeping Pad - Insulated & Ultralight Sleeping Bag Air Pad, Ideal for Camping, Hiking or Backpacking - Compact & Thick Lightweight Camping ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817LWRE0zPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our lightweight sleeping pad is a top-of-the-line outdoor product that features a dual-action; non-leak air valve that makes it possible to set up in less than a minute . You have the control. Made for Extreme Conditions When climbing Mount Everest, K2 or other mountains rest is essential! Now, getting your sleep after an exhausting day is made possible with our 2.35\" thick camping sleeping pad that measures a comfortable 75L x 22.8W, inches each. Its waterproof and rip-resistant 40D premium nylon fabric with TPU coating ensures that you get to rest on every terrain as nor rocks, gravel, or small twigs can puncture the mat. Experiencing more extreme conditions? Its R-value of 2.1 guarantees to keep you warm during cold winter nights. Superior Design Get the most out of the night with our interconnected hexagon air cells that adjust automatically depending on your sleeping position: back, side, or stomach! Its TPU coating ensures fewer plastic noises when moving around at night so that you are well rested to tackle the next trip. There is no set weight limit on our sleeping pads, however, we recommend adding a couple more breaths for a weight of 350 lbs. or more. No More Hustling Around Exhausted from carrying a heavy inflatable sleeping pad? With this compact and ultralight air pad, you don't have to worry about this ever again as it only weighs 1 lb and measures a portable size of 4\" x 8.7\" inches. This is just the size of a small water bottle so that always fits into your camping gear. Our Guarantee You are the most important to us! We are so confident that you will love our lightweight sleeping pads for backpacking, camping, and hiking that we offer a lifetime manufacturer guarantee on them. If you are unhappy with them in any way we will replace them free of charge or provide you with a full refund . Scroll up, click add to cart, see for yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817LWRE0zPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunrisr","source_asin":"B08M44TGTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M44TGTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M44TGTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
