window.products.push({"id":1097583,"name":"Andaz Press Terracotta Wedding Thank You Place Setting Cards for Table Reception, Dinner Plates, Wedding Favor Decoration Seating Settings for Guests,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXtC9bACL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Size: At the perfect size of 4 inches by 6 inches, these thank you place setting cards have multiple uses for weddings and special events. This pack of 56 place setting cards can be ordered in bulk and used at each seat within your wedding reception to display a heartfelt thank you from the newlywed couple. As a wedding thank you card the beautiful script will be placed in the center of one of our unique designs. Or display as a table card with designs to match your wedding decor perfectly. Material: Printed on 300 gsm cardstock paper, these high-quality 4\" x 6\" cards will boldly display wedding reception thank you cards for your guests. For the rustic wedding, there is a design that will match the table centerpieces along with the overall wedding decor. Used as thank you cards, each card is easy to place in card holders or on table settings making it a great table accessory for your wedding reception. Wedding Decor: Every last detail will come together at your wedding reception, even down to the table numbers and thank you place setting cards. Place these 4\" X 6\" place setting cards with the reception table numbers for guests to find their seats in style. Order multiple packs to use these cards as wedding thank you menu cards. Add to your wedding centerpieces for the reception by displaying a heartfelt thank you message and adding greenery and floral. Quality Designs: On high-quality paper, these 4\" x 6\" thank you cards are perfect for wedding table settings. For the wedding reception, select one of the many design themes to either match the seasons like spring, summer, or fall. Not limited to just one use, place as thank you cards from the newlyweds at each place setting for guests to take as a wedding keepsake. Select a eucalyptus or greenery theme thank you card and match the table numbers cards to complete the wedding table decor. Original Design: Share joy and a loving message with original designed wedding thank you menu cards for your guests. Choose from a variety of designs to suit your style or theme. Change up from the traditional thank you menu cards with one of our many original designs by Andaz. All rights reserved. Made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXtC9bACL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andaz Press","source_asin":"B092HKMSVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092HKMSVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092HKMSVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
