window.products.push({"id":1097605,"name":"Flickering Flameless Candles with Remote Control, Battery Operated Tealight Candle Set, Color Changing Led, Batteries Included, Get Yours Now!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91woLGx42SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring a spark of light into your life with these remote-control flameless candles! If you are planning for a party, a special event or you just want to “glow\" your environment than look no further because you have found the top quality table-decorations! These are the perfect candles for you! Your guests will love the ambiance you will create with these color-changing flickering candles that rapidly change between red, blue, green, white and yellow. They are perfect to be used on tall shelves, luminaries, small glasses and many other places that you can think about and you can make beautiful arrangements around most of the places around the house and outside. What is even more convenient about them it’s the remote control which basically allows you to have the mood in your hands and control it from up to 16 feet. These votive candles are 1.5 X 1.6 inches and come with batteries included so you don’t have to spend the extra bucks to purchase them. Each candle works with 3 button-cell batteries AG10 and the remote control comes with it’s own lithium battery CR2025. The LED is durable and it’s manufacturer guaranteed. You can have them running well over fifty hours in normal conditions and due to the strong ABS material they will color you moments for years to come! The mood is in your hands! For your peace of mind, if something goes wrong with the candles, don't worry, Home Decor Lights will fix it for you or give your money back, hassle free! So stop wasting time! Look no further, these are the perfect flameless candles for you! Buy them now while they are on stock at the sale price!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91woLGx42SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Decor Lights","source_asin":"B00SG930VS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SG930VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SG930VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1097606,"name":"Pink Paris Birthday Party Supplies Set Plates Napkins Cups Tableware Kit for 16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TvxhvVO-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM DESIGN - Our Pink Paris Themed Party Supplies are suitable for girl’s and boy’s birthday parties, holiday celebrations with your family and friends, special events or for just fun-filled daily meals, snacks, and desserts with picnics and cookouts. Shrieks of joy will be your reward when you use these fun and unique party tableware sets. DURABLE AND HIGH QUALITY - Brightly colored matte laminate designs help to prevent saturation. Birthday Galore party plates and cups are made from the highest-quality card stock giving superior durability for cake, ice cream, and more. Cups are reinforced with polyethylene coating to prevent leaks and give added rigidity while tightly rolled rims offer comfortable sipping. If any foods or beverages spill or drip, you can count on our hardy 2-ply napkins for quick clean up. WHAT’S INCLUDED IN PACKAGE – Our party pack serves up to 16 guests. The pack includes 16 dessert plates that are 7 inches, 16 napkins that are 6.5 inches, and 16 cups that hold 9 ounces of beverage. MORE TIME TO ENJOY – Our party tableware can be arranged creatively on your cake table to enhance your party decorations and make a stunning photo backdrop. Tableware is disposable for easy clean up. When the party ends simply dispose of everything and then relax. ECO-FRIENDLY – Birthday Galore paper plates, paper cups, and napkins are food safe, made of 100% food grade material. They are also biodegradable and recyclable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TvxhvVO-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Birthday Galore","source_asin":"B01N1S6LDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1S6LDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1S6LDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1097607,"name":"Alegacy Eagleware Professional Heavy-Duty Aluminum Flat Rim Pizza Tray, 11-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eEgJZ2foL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This 11-inch pizza tray from the Eagleware line of Alegacy professional cookware was designed for use in both the commercial and home kitchen. Constructed of heavy-duty, thick aluminum alloy which keeps the tray sturdy for extensive use while maintaining like-new appearances pizza after pizza. The flat rim of the tray is ideal for thin-crust or no-crust pizza. The edges are rolled to eliminate the problem of hard-to-clean openings. Proudly made in the USA and stamped with the Eagleware trademark of quality, durability and versatility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eEgJZ2foL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alegacy","source_asin":"B009VHQHFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009VHQHFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009VHQHFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
