window.products.push({"id":1097956,"name":"RolliCool 14,000 BTU Portable Air Conditioner Alexa-Enabled AC Unit with Heater, Dehumidifier, Fan, Mobile App (COOL100H)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5199N1freFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beat the heat than with a solution that is smart, luxurious, and multi-functional. Featuring 14,000 BTU and wireless options, the RolliCool COOL100H Portable Air Conditioner refreshes your ways in staying cool all summer long. The COOL100H is a versatile standing air conditioner that can pair with Amazon Alexa. Use voice commands to control your AC from anywhere in your home. Cool your living room, switch to fan mode, or warm your bedroom on chilly nights without leaving your couch or bed. Whether you’re too busy or too relaxed, adjusting your temperature and powering on your central air conditioner is only one command away. Just ask Alexa. With RolliCool, you don’t have to come home to a boiler room and wait for cool air to settle in. With the air conditioner’s 24-hour timer, you can schedule when your AC unit turns on and off throughout the day. Use its remote or control panel to schedule air conditioning before coming home after a long day. The included casters and window kit provide easy mobility throughout your house. This way, switching your small portable AC from room to room is a breeze. What’s even better is that you can control your air conditioning unit from anywhere in the world using your smartphone. Download the iOS/Android-compatible RolliCool app to set up heating and cooling schedules, switch between modes, adjust fan directions, and change fan speeds. If you have pets waiting at home, use the app to activate the AC’s cooling mode and keep your pets comfortable during those sweltering summer days.Discover new ways to beat the heat with the RolliCool COOL100H portable AC unit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5199N1freFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rollibot","source_asin":"B07CRS7PK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1097956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CRS7PK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CRS7PK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
